<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Forcenergy started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Forcenergy started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said it initiated coverage of Forcenergy Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- set a 12-month price target of $36 on the stock.</p>
<p>-- said recent acquisitions in Alaska, the Gulf of Mexico and the Permian Basin should accelerate production and cash flow in 1997.</p>
<p>-- said rapidly growing production should provide impressive earnings and cash flow gains this year, despite declining commodity prices.</p>
<p>-- said expects Forcenergy to earn about $1.10 a share in 1997 and $1.15 a share in 1998.</p>
<p>-- Forcenergy was up 1/2 to 29-3/4 at midday.</p>
</text>
